They would rather have me dependent on

00:36:29.933 --> 00:36:33.300
the pills they're producing
so that I could buy them

00:36:33.366 --> 00:36:37.333
forever. And then I also
realized... No, I'm not saying

00:36:37.400 --> 00:36:43.433
