00:36:55.300 --> 00:36:59.100
But what I'm saying is we overuse pills.

00:36:59.133 --> 00:37:03.066
- Yeah, it's always good to study and deeply
understand the incentives under which

00:37:03.133 --> 00:37:04.033
the world operates

00:37:05.000 --> 00:37:08.433
so that you don't get swept up into
