00:41:38.233 --> 00:41:42.000
companies that achieve the scale that
Telegram does, it has very few employees.

00:41:42.000 --> 00:41:48.566
So how many people are on the core team,
let's say the core engineering team?

00:41:48.600 --> 00:41:54.600
- The core engineering team is
