00:45:14.366 --> 00:45:17.933
while also making it much more

00:45:18.000 --> 00:45:21.933
reliable. Because if some part
of the network goes down,

00:45:21.966 --> 00:45:25.666
can still switch to the other parts of it.

00:45:25.733 --> 00:45:29.566
- Yeah. One of the big ways
to protect user privacy

