00:45:37.700 --> 00:45:40.766
many legal jurisdictions with the decryption
keys. So it's encrypted in the cloud,

00:45:40.866 --> 00:45:44.833
keys. So it's encrypted in the
cloud, the decryption keys are split

00:45:44.933 --> 00:45:48.933
and kept in different locations so
that no single government or entity

00:45:49.000 --> 00:45:55.466
entity can access the data. Can you
explain the strength of this approach?

00:45:55.533 --> 00:45:58.533
- The way we designed Telegram is

00:46:00.666 --> 00:46:07.266
we never wanted to have any humans,
any employees have any access

00:46:08.133 --> 00:46:15.800
