00:48:56.766 --> 00:49:00.633
- So that's one of the principles
you operate under: you're going to

00:49:00.666 --> 00:49:03.166
protect user privacy.

00:49:03.233 --> 00:49:10.333
- I think it's fundamental. Without the right
to privacy, people can't feel fully free

00:49:10.333 --> 00:49:11.233
