04:15:40.966 --> 04:15:47.533
- I'm incredibly lucky to have my father.

04:15:48.366 --> 04:15:55.866
He's a person who wrote countless books
on ancient Rome and ancient Roman

04:15:55.900 --> 04:15:59.700
literature, dozens of

04:16:00.766 --> 04:16:06.200
scientific papers, and I always
remember him working. He would be

04:16:06.466 --> 04:16:11.666
