04:16:48.066 --> 04:16:54.133
So observing our father was
a big lesson by itself.

04:16:55.900 --> 04:16:58.266
It wasn't necessary for
him to say anything to us.

04:16:59.266 --> 04:17:03.900
And then at the same time, he was
incredibly patient, emotionally

04:17:04.000 --> 04:17:11.566
resilient. And, you know, my mom,
great woman, incredibly smart, highly

04:17:11.666 --> 04:17:21.900
educated, but she would sometimes try to
test the patience of my father, and it's a

04:17:23.800 --> 04:17:27.733
trait rooted in our biology. There's

04:17:27.766 --> 04:17:34.200
an evolutionary explanation for that, that
women sometimes tend to do that. And he

04:17:34.333 --> 04:17:42.133
