what AGI, AI is able to

04:19:13.700 --> 04:19:16.800
achieve, and conscience is the thing that

04:19:18.666 --> 04:19:23.566
humans have. The ability to
know the right from wrong.

04:19:23.666 --> 04:19:27.366
- This is the lesson that he gave me.

04:19:29.200 --> 04:19:32.933
One of my goals in life is
never to disappoint him.

04:19:33.800 --> 04:19:37.733
- Another thing we've talked
about, which I think is a

04:19:38.300 --> 04:19:43.900
fascinating topic, is the power
